1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,024
In this final lesson of the Sites module,

2
00:00:03,024 --> 00:00:07,333
you'll publish a blog post that helps
new patients find you on Google,

3
00:00:07,333 --> 00:00:11,765
and create QR codes that turn posters
and leaflets into trackable leads.

4
00:00:12,616 --> 00:00:14,180
Go to Sites, then Blogs.

5
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:18,807
Every post answers a question your
customers are already searching for,

6
00:00:18,807 --> 00:00:20,828
like how much Invisalign costs.

7
00:00:20,828 --> 00:00:25,520
Each one is a new way for people to
find you, long after you publish it.

8
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:31,054
Categories group related posts together,
and Authors shows who wrote what.

9
00:00:31,054 --> 00:00:35,231
Both help readers, and search
engines, make sense of your content.

10
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:39,082
Click New Blog Post, and
start with the title.

11
00:00:39,082 --> 00:00:42,802
Write it the way people search,
as a question if you can.

12
00:00:42,802 --> 00:00:46,588
Notice the URL slug fills in
automatically from the title.

13
00:00:47,441 --> 00:00:49,038
Staring at a blank page?

14
00:00:49,038 --> 00:00:53,897
Click Content AI, describe what the
post should cover, and choose a tone.

15
00:00:53,897 --> 00:00:58,756
Content AI is billed by usage on
Starter and Growth, and included on Pro.

16
00:00:59,607 --> 00:01:01,980
In seconds, you have a full first draft.

17
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:04,947
Always read it through and
make it sound like you.

18
00:01:04,947 --> 00:01:09,812
Check prices and facts, and add a personal
touch, like a story from your practice.

19
00:01:10,663 --> 00:01:12,745
On the right are the post settings.

20
00:01:12,745 --> 00:01:16,670
The meta description is the snippet
Google shows under your title.

21
00:01:16,670 --> 00:01:20,774
Add alt text to the featured image,
and choose a category and author.

22
00:01:21,624 --> 00:01:23,446
When it's ready, click Publish.

23
00:01:23,446 --> 00:01:25,856
Publish it now, or schedule it for later,

24
00:01:25,856 --> 00:01:29,912
so you can write several posts in
one sitting and release one a week.

25
00:01:30,764 --> 00:01:31,692
Now, QR codes.

26
00:01:31,692 --> 00:01:34,477
They connect the real world to your pages.

27
00:01:34,477 --> 00:01:39,913
A poster in your window, a leaflet, or a
business card can send people straight to

28
00:01:39,913 --> 00:01:43,029
a funnel, a booking
calendar, or a review page.

29
00:01:43,878 --> 00:01:48,556
Click Create QR Code and give it a name
that says where it will be printed.

30
00:01:48,556 --> 00:01:50,178
Then choose where it goes.

31
00:01:50,178 --> 00:01:53,733
We'll send this leaflet to
the Invisalign free scan page.

32
00:01:54,583 --> 00:01:56,296
Leave tracking switched on.

33
00:01:56,296 --> 00:01:58,770
Kyntlo adds UTM parameters to the link,

34
00:01:58,770 --> 00:02:03,275
so every lead from this leaflet shows
its source on the contact record.

35
00:02:03,275 --> 00:02:05,686
Name the campaign after the print run.

36
00:02:06,511 --> 00:02:09,733
Pick a colour and add
your logo in the centre.

37
00:02:09,733 --> 00:02:11,974
Then create it, and download it.

38
00:02:11,974 --> 00:02:17,717
Choose PNG for everyday use, or SVG for
print, because it stays sharp at any size.

39
00:02:18,566 --> 00:02:21,710
Visits from the QR code
appear in your funnel stats,

40
00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:24,611
and new leads carry the
leaflet as their source.

41
00:02:24,611 --> 00:02:28,177
So you finally know whether
that print run paid for itself.

42
00:02:29,027 --> 00:02:30,075
Here's a pro tip.

43
00:02:30,075 --> 00:02:32,539
Before you send anything to the printer,

44
00:02:32,539 --> 00:02:37,590
scan the QR code with two different phones,
and make sure it opens the right page.

45
00:02:37,590 --> 00:02:39,007
Reprints are expensive.

46
00:02:39,914 --> 00:02:42,193
That's the Sites module complete!

47
00:02:42,193 --> 00:02:46,543
You can now build funnels,
websites, forms, blogs and QR codes.

48
00:02:46,543 --> 00:02:51,308
Next, in Module 8, we'll start
marketing to your contacts with email,

49
00:02:51,308 --> 00:02:52,758
SMS and social media.

50
00:02:52,758 --> 00:02:53,725
See you there.
